BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:165093@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260915T112201Z
DTSTART:20260904T153000Z
SUMMARY:ISO New England has made revisions to the MIS report descriptions for the following reports impacted by the FCM PFP change (Pending FERC Approval)\, with the first release expected no sooner than October 7\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England has made revisions to the MIS report descriptions for the following reports impacted by the FCM PFP change (Pending FERC Approval)\, with the first release expected no sooner than October 7\, 2026. The link will display the report's description and change summary\, including details of the reports’ modifications.\n\nSD_FCMPFPACP: Modified\, effective 10/01/2026\n\nSD_FCMPFPACPPRELIM: Modified\, effective 10/01/2026\n\nSD_FCMPFPSCORE: Modified\, effective 10/01/2026\n\nSD_FCMPFPSCOREPRELIM: Modified\, effective 10/01/2026\n\nComplete details can be found on the MIS Report Descriptions\, Templates and Samples web page. The most recent version of each MIS report distributed by the ISO is available in the All Reports pdf document\, the all templates ZIP file and the all samples ZIP file. The formatting of MIS csv files into their corresponding Excel templates can be performed by installing and enabling the MIS Report Format Macro-Enabled Add-In for Excel 2016.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165093
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165093
END:VEVENT
